APRM
Anatomical Prior-Guided Routing for 3D Lung Tumor Segmentation
Uihyeon Maeng, Jonghun Kim, and Hyunjin Park

This repository contains a modified nnU-Net v2 pipeline from the source
snapshot supplied with APRM (upstream package metadata: version 2.6.4).
Upstream project: https://github.com/MIC-DKFZ/nnUNet

Original nnU-Net copyright notices and the Apache License 2.0 are retained.
Original authors include Fabian Isensee and the HIP Applied Computer Vision
Lab / Division of Medical Image Computing, German Cancer Research Center
(DKFZ), Heidelberg, Germany.

Modified files use the aprm namespace, APRM command names, the fixed
all-encoder anatomical routing model, and its anatomy-aware data paths.
See documentation/implementation_notes.md for the release changes.

TotalSegmentator and dynamic-network-architectures are separate third-party
projects and are not vendored here. Their own licenses apply.
